            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Aki 0.4.4</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The right session, by itself:</b> marking starts on the agent tab you're in, or were in a moment ago, before the page's port.</li>
<li><b>⌘Z</b> undoes the last mark.</li>
<li><b>Space</b> held while dragging moves the whole area, as the Mac's ⌘⇧4.</li>
<li>⇧ in the middle of a drag no longer gets in the way.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
