        <item>
            <title>0.4.3</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:46:47 -0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20261010154647</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Aki 0.4.3</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Add up with ⇧ and the arrows:</b> the next thing joins what's outlined, and ⏎ marks them as one area. The opposite arrow takes the last one back out.</li>
<li><b>Bigger and smaller</b> are now ⌘↑ / ⌘↓.</li>
<li><b>Hold ⇧ to use the page below</b> while marking: click, hover, open its menus. Let go and Aki is back with a fresh picture.</li>
<li><b>Each session has its own colour</b>, so a mark's colour says where it goes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
